1
00:00:00,471 --> 00:00:01,851
(Sheldon:)Good to know.

2
00:00:02,014 --> 00:00:04,264
(Penny:)Big old five.

3
00:00:13,609 --> 00:00:15,529
(Sheldon:)- Hello.
- Hi.

4
00:00:15,694 --> 00:00:17,024
(Sheldon:)Leonard, this is Tom.

5
00:00:20,825 --> 00:00:21,865
(Leonard:)Hi, Tom. Sheldon.

6
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:30,710
(Leonard:)Didn't I explain to you
about your little mistake in the cafeteria?

7
00:00:30,876 --> 00:00:34,216
(Sheldon:)Yes, you were very clear,
as was everyone else at the table.

8
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:40,550
(Sheldon:)Tom, however, has been chosen by science
as a suitable mate for Penny.

9
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:42,049
(Sheldon:)Chosen by science.

10
00:00:42,221 --> 00:00:44,641
(Sheldon:)Well, what passes for science
on dating sites.

11
00:00:45,975 --> 00:00:49,815
They may claim to use heuristic algorithms,
but it may well be hokum.

12
00:00:50,479 --> 00:00:52,939
(Leonard:)You got Penny to sign up
for online dating?

13
00:00:53,107 --> 00:00:57,407
No, no, of course not.
No, see, I used trickery and deceit.

14
00:00:58,946 --> 00:01:00,656
(Leonard:)This is bad.

